        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Declaration of the Rights of Man and of the Citizen</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">1789 CE – present</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Made by</span><span class="info-stat-val"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/france">France</a>'s National Constituent Assembly, 1789; drafted first by the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/marquis-de-lafayette">Marquis de Lafayette</a> with <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/thomas-jefferson">Thomas Jefferson</a>'s assistance, with the majority of the final draft coming from <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/emmanuel-joseph-sieyes">Abbé Sieyès</a> and Honoré Mirabeau's editing</span></div>
